# Model parameters
Max Tokens -- Is how much token response it needs to send
Temperature -- 0-1 --> randomness of the output generated in the model -->0 meaning very determinstic 1 will be creative
Top p -> 0.1 top 10% 1 100% -  the model chooses which next token to choose from

Prompting
zero shot prompting -- less and clear input
Few shot prompting -- giving example
prompt engineering -- chain of thought prompting


